@nsobid-FF1D1C05670DB6021C85B624A710B963

# Animal Crossing: New Horizons 3.0.3 - Disable anti-aliasing

@flag print_values
@flag offset_shift 0x100

// Disables the post-process anti-aliasing pass.
//
// agl::pfx::FilterAA draws the final image through one of its AA modes,
// picked by an antialias_type parameter that scene settings can change:
// 0 = FXAA, 1 = ReduceAA, 2 = SMAA. When the filter
// is off it instead copies the image through unchanged. The FXAA and SMAA
// cases are redirected to that pass-through copy, so the output is the
// engine's own no-AA image and a scene selecting either mode cannot turn
// edge AA back on. ReduceAA is left alone.

@enabled
0393EA08 46000014   // B pass-through (FXAA case, was LDR S0,[X21,#0x988])
0393ECF4 8BFFFF17   // B pass-through (SMAA case, was MOV X0,X21)
@stop

// Offsets reverse-engineered against Animal Crossing: New Horizons 3.0.3
// (sead + agl/gsys, NVN). The retail build is symbol-stripped; every site was
// located by structure and byte-verified against the IDB before being written.
//
// https://github.com/RAMDRAGONS/switch-patches
